# Local-only settings and secrets
# appsettings.json itself IS committed - it only ever holds blank
# placeholder values, with real credentials injected at deploy time via
# environment variables (see DEPLOYMENT.md). appsettings.Development.json
# and dotnet user-secrets' local secrets.json are excluded since neither
# should ever be relied on to hold real values either, but doubly so if a
# real value is ever pasted in by mistake during local testing.
appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json
*.pfx
*.key

# Vercel
.vercel
